My younger sister Sofia comes there.
She grabs the phone.
She laughs happily.
"Hey Maya, how are you?" she asks.
"I am fine," I say.
I grab my mobile phone.
On its screen, there is a picture.
I show that picture in front of the laptop.
In the picture, I am smiling.
Near me, there is a woman.
"Who is she?" Sofia asks.
"This is my friend," I say.
"Her name is Asha."
"She lives in my building."
"Here, she is my neighbour."
"Asha is beautiful," Sofia says.
"Yes," I say.
I laugh, and she also laughs.
